@startuml paquetes
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Diagrama de Paquetes y Fronteras Modulares

package "Frontend (apps/web - SPA React 19)" as WebSPA {
    [features/pos] as F_POS
    [features/cocina] as F_KDS
    [features/caja] as F_Caja
    [features/admin] as F_Admin
}

package "Núcleo Compartido (packages/shared)" as PkgShared {
    [money.ts\n(Enteros COP)] as M_Money
    [enums.ts\n(Enums Dominio)] as M_Enums
    [schemas/*\n(Esquemas Zod)] as M_Schemas
    [fecha-operativa.ts] as M_Fecha
}

package "Backend (apps/api - NestJS 12)" as ApiNest {
    
    package "Módulos de Operación" as OpsMods {
        [pedidos\n(pedidos.public.ts)] as ModPed
        [cocina\n(cocina.public.ts)] as ModCoc
        [caja\n(caja.public.ts)] as ModCaj
    }

    package "Módulos de Catálogo e Insumos" as CatMods {
        [catalogo\n(catalogo.public.ts)] as ModCat
        [inventario\n(inventario.public.ts)] as ModInv
        [clientes\n(clientes.public.ts)] as ModCli
    }

    package "Módulos Transversales" as CrossMods {
        [identidad\n(identidad.public.ts)] as ModId
        [realtime\n(SSE Hub)] as ModRT
        [administracion\n(KPIs & Audit)] as ModAdm
    }

    package "shared-kernel" as Kernel {
        [db (Drizzle & Pool)] as K_Db
        [event-bus (Bus Tx)] as K_Bus
        [outbox (Dispatcher)] as K_Outbox
    }
}

WebSPA ..> PkgShared : tipos y contratos
ApiNest ..> PkgShared : validaciones Zod

' Dependencias estrictas vía *.public.ts
ModPed ..> ModInv : consumir stock (tx)
ModPed ..> ModCoc : crear comanda (tx)
ModPed ..> ModCat : consulta precios
ModCaj ..> ModPed : prepararCobro y cerrar (tx)
ModInv ..> ModCat : resuelve recetas

' Kernel y Outbox
ApiNest ..> Kernel : usa DB y EventBus
K_Outbox ..> ModRT : notifica post-commit
ModRT ..> WebSPA : Server-Sent Events

note bottom of ApiNest
  <b>Regla Arquitectónica:</b>
  Comunicación inter-modular restringida exclusivamente a
  interfaces públicas <i>*.public.ts</i> o <i>EventBus</i> transaccional.
  Verificado por <i>dependency-cruiser</i> (0 violaciones).
end note

@enduml
